  "groupId": "main_1",
  "stageId": "main_01-12",
  "title": "Pyrrhic Victory",
  "storyCode": "1-12",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-12_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f53c39dc58d24ad6a9bb43e25b6153e29c576c8d7cb86607005100044b8d161e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十二关（前）\nTime - Unknown \\ Weather - Unknown \\ Visibility - Poor\nChernobog - Operation Squad E0's Location\nDr. {@nickname} Rescue Operation - Final Retreat Phase"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Damn it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Even though we've already made it to the exit...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "Did you really think we'd let you just stroll out of Chernobog?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "Don't you think it's about time for someone to wake you from your daydream?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Our commmunications have been restored, and I've contact O.P.D. They'll be joining up with us shortly!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "But, this blasted..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "Watch out, she's holding onto explosives!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "I still can't get in touch with the recon team!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "... Who exactly are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "I don't expect you to know who I am..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "But, I know that person next to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Is Reunion... going to continue fighting us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "Hey, hey, don't be like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "I have no love for that she-dragon, Talulah. I'm not even cut out for this goaltending business. It's a pain to have to rush over here after a long day of work."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "So for the sake of future cooperation, why don't we exchange some pleasantries first?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "You may simply call me... W."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "I've waited a long time to see that person next to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...Doctor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "Dr.{@Nickname}......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "I have a few little questions I'd like to ask {@Nickname}. Would you be so kind as to give us some... alone time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "You're wasting your breath."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "--Don't be so hasty. I have some information you might be interested in."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "Actually, we just met some rather slick fellows... Quite skilled, and dressed just like you guys."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "Though their camouflage might have been enough to fool Ursus, I saw right through their little trick~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Could they be from the recon team?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "I'm glad... that they're safe..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "Little bunny, are you their leader?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "? !"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "I'm quite curious, what charm do you hold over them... so that they'd give their lives so enthusiastically and unremorsefully for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "What... are you saying...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "You heard me. None of them... will be returning to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "Hey, you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
      "text": "Are you really... worth sacrificing their lives over?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Don't worry about her. The exit's right there!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Amiya...",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "What's the point of you doing this, W?",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "text": "I'm not done talking yet."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "text": "Amiya..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "text": "... Did I make you mad?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "... You've gone too far."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "text": "Good, good... Now that's more like it."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "text": "Come at me."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "W of the Reunion Movement, you've gone too far!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Every life is precious, each and every one..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "This is something that you'll never tarnish!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Doctor!!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Rhodes Island, prepare for combat!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": "char_1504_cqbw",
          "text": "Heheh..."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
